      "short": "4 purple sectors and 1 each of pink, green, blue and yellow; all 8 sectors equal. Order may vary.",
      "worked": "Half of 8 sectors is 4, so colour 4 sectors purple. The other four required colours each occupy one remaining sector. Blue and yellow then have the same chance.",
